  "correctValue": "0.5",
  "solution": {
    "text": "For&nbsp;<math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> to be continuous at <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></math>,<br /><math><mrow><mrow><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">lim</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></munder></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Now,&nbsp;<math><mrow><mrow><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">lim</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></munder></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ln</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>&#955;</mi></math><br />Putting&nbsp;<math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi></math>, we get,<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>&#8901;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>tan</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>&#955;</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8901;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>tan</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>t</mi></mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>&#8901;</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>&#955;</mi></math><br />So,&nbsp;<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
